    "description": "Round 4 item 2 (openspec change round4-readable-values-and-tour-titles). The client, lead and service pages showed stored codes (person, organization, open, normal, free, staff). nextcloud-vue renders a property's x-enum-labels in forms, filters, table cells and detail fields, through the app's translate, so every enum on these schemas carries an English label here. Each label has an en and an nl catalogue entry. Presentation only: no value a record may hold changes. Named 99-zz so it merges after the fragments that declare these schemas."
